| Drug Efficacy Prediction | **Oracle** | `/predict_variant_impact` + S/P/E fusion |
| Resistance Prediction | **Oracle** | `/predict_protein_functionality_change` |
| Treatment Line Intelligence | **Oracle** | Pathway-based sequencing |
| SAE Explainability | **Oracle** | SAE feature visualization |

### Toxicity Risk Co-Pilot → Products:

